"115 Offline" = "115 离线";
"The system Settings app can only store the 115 Cookie in UserDefaults temporarily. When you return to JavDB, the plugin immediately moves it into the Keychain (ThisDeviceOnly) and deletes the plaintext. The text field will look empty afterwards; that does not mean the cookie was lost. It will not be written back to UserDefaults or logs. Use the floating-button panel to confirm. The folder CID is stored in UserDefaults (not a secret)." = "系统设置只能把 115 Cookie 临时写到 UserDefaults。回到 JavDB 后，插件会立即把它迁入本机钥匙串（ThisDeviceOnly）并删除明文。之后这个文本框可能是空的，不代表 Cookie 已丢失，也不会把完整 Cookie 写回 UserDefaults 或日志。请到浮钮面板确认。离线目录 CID 存在 UserDefaults（不是密钥）。";
"Cookie status" = "Cookie 状态";
"Not saved" = "未保存";
"115 Cookie" = "115 Cookie";
"Offline folder CID" = "离线目录 CID";
"Clear saved 115 Cookie" = "清除已保存的 115 Cookie";
"Ads" = "广告";
"When on, native hooks may cancel identified in-house ad APIs (/api/v1/ads and /api/v1/ads/splash_log on jdforrepam.com / letidi.com) if they go through NSURLSession or WKWebView. For a short time after launch the plugin also tries to activate a Flutter splash-ad Skip control (跳过) via FlutterEngine ensureSemanticsEnabled. It does not skip SplashPage startup work (domain probe, update, local auth), hide the first window, or touch payment/auth. Home and magnet-page ads still use dart:io TLS and usually cannot be blocked. This has not been device-tested and does not claim the opening ad is removed. No AdMob/Unity/Pangle/GDT SDK was found." = "开启后，仅当请求走 NSURLSession 或 WKWebView 时，可能拦截可识别的应用内广告接口（jdforrepam.com / letidi.com 上的 /api/v1/ads 与 /api/v1/ads/splash_log）。启动后短时间内，插件还会通过 FlutterEngine 的 ensureSemanticsEnabled，尝试激活开屏广告上可识别的「跳过」控件。不会跳过 SplashPage 的域名探测/更新检查/本机认证，不会清空首屏，也不会改支付或登录接口。首页和磁力页广告仍走 dart:io TLS，通常无法拦截。未经真机验证，不能声称开屏广告已被移除。未发现 AdMob、Unity、穿山甲/Pangle、广点通等第三方 SDK。";
"Block identified ad requests" = "拦截可识别的广告请求";
"External library" = "外部数据库";
"The API token is also staged in UserDefaults by system Settings, then moved into the Keychain and deleted. The field will not show the token again. Changing the server URL requires entering a new token so the old token is never sent to a different host." = "API Token 同样会先被系统设置暂存到 UserDefaults，再迁入钥匙串并删除明文。文本框不会回显 Token。更换服务器时必须重新输入令牌，避免把旧令牌发到新主机。";
"Token status" = "令牌状态";
"Enable external library" = "启用外部数据库";
"Server root URL" = "服务器根地址";
"API Token" = "API Token";
